{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-041.md","record_count":41,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சமையல்காரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏம்மா? இப்படி கவலையா இருக்கீங்க? கொஞ்சம் காப்பியாவது சாப்பிடுங்கம்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்தம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அட நீ போப்பா நீ முருகா—இப்படி வா—இப்படி உட்காரு! அந்தப் பொண்ணு விவரம் சொன்னியே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓ! அது ரொம்ப மிஞ்சிப் போச்சே...இப்ப கல்யாணத்துக்கே ஏற்பாடு நடந்துகிட்டு இருக்கே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! கல்யாணமா? ரெண்டாவது கல்யாணமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா...இல்லீங்க! அவனுக்கு இன்னும் கல்யாணமே ஆகலீங்களே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எவனுக்குடா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நம்ம சங்கரம் பயலுக்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சங்கரம்பயலுக்கா? நல்ல ஆளுப்பா நீ! இவ்வளவு நாளா அவனைப்பத்திதான் சொல்லிக்கிட்டு இருக்கிறியா நீ...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாங்க...நான் வேற யாரைப்பத்தி சொல்றது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா! அந்தப் பொண்ணுன்னு சொன்னியே அது...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அது நம்ப வேலைக்காரப் பொண்ணுங்க! இங்க இருக்காளே வேலைக்காரி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடச்சீ...அய்யா, பொண்ணோடெ சுத்தாராருன்னு சொன்னியடா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நான் அவனைத்தானுங்க—அந்தப் பய செய்யற தப்பை நெனைச்சிகிட்டு அவனை அய்யான்னு...அய்யாகூட வர்ராங்களே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன, இங்கு விசாரணை நடக்குது?...உ...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...இங்க விசாரம்தான் இருக்கு, 'ணை' இல்லை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரிதான்! சரி...உம். நீ போயி சமையலை கவனி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சமையல் ஆயிடுச்சுங்க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆயிடுச்சா? ஆயிடுச்சில்ல...அப்ப கொஞ்சம் போட்டு தின்னு...நாய்... (சாந்தத்திடம்) இந்தா நான் ஒன்பேர்லே உள்ள சந்தேகத்தை வாபஸ் வாங்கிட்டேன். நீயும் அதே மாதிரி செய்யவேண்டியதுதானே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னாது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பாரு, ராஜாவும் நல்லவன்; நீயும் நல்லவ! அதே மாதிரி என்னையும் நல்லவன்னு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்! ராஜாவும் நல்லவருல்ல; நானும் நல்லவ இல்ல; முன்னால நெனச்சிங்க பாருங்க; அதே மாதிரிதான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடா...அடா...இந்தாப் பாரு! நான் என்னமோ தப்பா நடக்கறதா நெனைச்சிக்கிட்டு நீ தப்பா நடக்கிறமாதிரி ஆக்ட் பண்றே...ஆ! அந்தப் பொண்ணு இருக்கே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அழகான பொண்ணு! கவர்ச்சியானவ! பருவமங்கை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதைச் சொல்லலே! வந்து அவ ரொம்ப ஏழை! ஆனா புத்திசாலி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! புத்திசாலி இல்லேன்னா வயசான ஆளை 'கவர்' பண்ண முடியுமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஈ, ஈ...! இது சரிப்பட்டு வராது...ஊக்கும்...எங்கியோ ஆறோ கொளமோ பாக்க வேண்டியதுதான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏன் அவளோட நீச்சல் விளையாட்டு நடத்தவா? ஜலக்கிரீடை...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யக்காவ்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னடா தம்பீ?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அக்கா! அனாவசியமா, எனக்கும் அந்த ராஜாவுக்கும் மனஸ்தாபம் ஏற்பட்டதாலே, ஊர் பூரா எனக்கு ஒரே கெட்டபேரு அக்கா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதுக்கு என்ன இப்போ?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எப்படியாவது மறுபடியும் அந்த ராஜாகூட சேர்ந்து நாடகத்திலே நடிச்சி... எனக்குள்ள கெட்ட பேரெல்லாம் போக்கணும்கா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதுக்கு ராஜா சம்மதிக்கணுமே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d034","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யார்தான் சம்மதிப்பா? ராஜா மனசு நோகும்படி என்னென்ன அக்ரமம் பண்ணி இருக்கிறான் இவன்! அதனாலே இவனை சேத்துக்க மாட்டாங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d035","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏன் சேத்துக்க மாட்டாங்க ராஜா நான் என்ன சொன்னாலும் கேப்பாரு! தம்பீ, நீ வாடா நான் சேக்கிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d036","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தா...இந்தா...வீண் ஜம்பம் அடிச்சு அங்கே போயி அவமானப்படாதே! அவ்வளவுதான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d037","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! தம்பீ ஒன்னையும் அந்தக் கம்பெனிலே சேத்து, அந்தப் பொண்ணையும் அந்தக் கம்பெனிலே இருந்து வெலக்கல. என் பேரு சாந்தம்மா இல்லே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d038","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யோ! அய்யோ! அந்தப் பொண்ணு பாவம், பாவம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d039","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யோ... அய்யோ... தவிக்கிறதைப் பார்ரா... அடப்போய்யா, வாடா தம்பீ...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d040","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அத்தான்! வர்ரேன்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s041-d041","scene_id":"raja-rani-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம். வர்ரேன்... அத்தான் வர்ரேன். உம்...அய்யோ! இந்த ஒரு ராஜாவும் ராணியும் வந்தது இந்த குடும்பத்தை சீட்டு கட்டு கலைக்கிறாப்பிலே கலைச்சுட்டாங்களே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"}]}
